# Panes - tmux (actions/tmux/tmux_panes.kbd)
**panes + ent**    -- Pane Maximize (A-b z)
**panes + h**      -- Pane Left (A-b [left])
**panes + l**      -- Pane Right (A-b [right])
**panes + up**     -- Pane Above (A-b [up])
**panes + j**      -- Pane Below (A-b [down])
**panes + -**      -- Pane H Split (A-b ")
**panes + \**      -- Pane V Split (A-b %)
**panes + w**      -- Pane Close (A-b x)
**panes + toggle** -- Pane Toggle (A-b ;)
